---
import styles from "./features.module.css";
---

<div class={styles.main}>
    <h2>Feature list</h2>
    <p>The bot has some really cool features, here are some picks:</p>
    <br />

    <!-- Temporary voice channels -->
    <div class={styles.featleft}>
        <h3>Temporary voice channels</h3>
        <p>With temporary voice channels, you can let your members create as many temporary voice channels as they want.</p>
        <p class={styles.newfeat}>NEW: Private Temporary Channels: Create temporary voice channels without giving access to everyone at once.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Chat Summaries -->
    <div class={styles.featright}>
        <h3>Chat Summaries</h3>
        <p>Chat Summaries every midnight! No AI, these summaries give counts of messages at the end of the day.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Chat Streaks -->
    <div class={styles.featleft}>
        <h3>Chat Streaks</h3>
        <p>Count how many consencutive days a member has been active in your server.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- More! -->
    <a href="/features" style="text-decoration: none; color: white;">
        <div class={styles.featright}>
            <h3>More!</h3>
            <p>Check out the full list on the features page.</p>
        </div>
    </a>
</div>
